#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:18
#: 4c0856e8347343f89bb9955407e4bb2e
msgid "Connecting a Receiver"
msgstr "连接接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:20
#: 132b22ce3f014ee2b37be3b50cb0776b
msgid ""
"Connect your RC receiver \"S\" (signal) pins to the \"S\" pins on Inputs "
"of APM using a (minimum 5 pin) `jumper cable (6-pin-to-6-pin-individual-"
"female-15cm) <http://dronefever.com/Jumper-cable-6-pin-to-6-pin-"
"individual-female-15cm.html>`__. You must connect at least channels 1 ~ "
"5.  Channels 6 ~ 8 are optional."
msgstr ""
"使用（至少 5 针）`跳线（6 针转 6 针单独母头 15cm）<http://dronefever.com/Jumper-cable-6"
"-pin-to-6-pin-individual-female-15cm.html>`__ 将 RC 接收机的「S」（信号）引脚连接到 APM "
"输入的「S」引脚。您至少必须连接第 1～5 通道。第 6～8 通道是可选的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:28
#: c0928fbab7e047ba960a99f2d00d9500
msgid ""
"Your RC receiver will require power. Normally this is done by using one 2"
" or 3 wire connector between the APM Inputs and one channel output on the"
" receiver. See :ref:`APM Power Details <common-"
"apm25-and-26-overview_powering_the_apm2>` for limitations and important "
"warnings."
msgstr ""
"您的 RC 接收机需要供电。通常使用 APM 输入和接收机的一个通道输出之间的 2 或 3 针连接器实现。有关限制和重要警告，请参阅 "
":ref:`APM 电源详情 <common-apm25-and-26-overview_powering_the_apm2>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:39
#: 75210610d3f14b90b9de694b8606bdc0
msgid "Connecting a PPM Sum Receiver"
msgstr "连接 PPM Sum 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:41
#: 59d067a7da69497c90019ae42a9644f8
msgid ""
"PPM receivers transmit all the channel information above through a single"
" port (some will transmit additional channels - for example the FrSky "
"D8RSP receiver outputs 7 PWM channels, while in CPPM mode it will output "
"8)."
msgstr ""
"PPM 接收机通过单个端口传输上述所有通道信息（部分会传输额外通道——例如 FrSky D8RSP 接收机输出 7 个 PWM 通道，在 CPPM"
" 模式下将输出 8 个）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:46
#: c754a4f2d6784c788f1f59775902753e
msgid ""
"On APM2 you can use PPM input by putting a `jumper "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9044>`__ on the RC inputs for channel "
"2 and 3 (just the signal pins). PPM input from the receiver should be fed"
" into channel 1."
msgstr ""
"在 APM2 上，可以通过在第 2 和第 3 通道的 RC 输入（仅信号引脚）上放置 `跳线 "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9044>`__ 来使用 PPM 输入。来自接收机的 PPM 输入应接入第 "
"1 通道。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-connecting-the-radio-receiver-apm2.rst:54
#: 22ab0242523e4f3eac29b82f3919ea36
msgid ""
"If you need to rearrange the channel order when using PPM and are unable "
"to do this from the transmitter, you can do this with the RCMAP Advanced "
"parameters. Read more about them :ref:`here <parameters_RCMAP_>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您在使用 PPM 时需要重新排列通道顺序，且无法从发射机上完成，可以通过 RCMAP 高级参数实现。在 :ref:`此处 "
"<parameters_RCMAP_>` 了解更多信息。"

